cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the software repository as follows."
title: "Exact Second-Order Strong-Coupling Expansion of the Spectral Gap of Kogut-Susskind Lattice Gauge Theory on the Three-Torus"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Gerald (full author name to be supplied before submission)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GeWoHu/su2-lattice-gap-perturbation"
date-released: 2026-11-05
abstract: >-
  Fixed-volume strong-coupling expansion of the spectral gap of SU(2)
  Kogut-Susskind lattice gauge theory on the three-torus with exact
  second-order coefficient -142/105 (relative 284/315), unique band head
  at zero momentum, and a complete machine-checked verification package.
  Novelty classification unresolved pending comparison with
  Kogut-Sinclair-Susskind (1976); no originality claimed.
keywords:
  - lattice gauge theory
  - strong-coupling expansion
  - spectral gap
  - perturbation theory
  - exact verification
